<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#8b5cf6">
<title>For Minju ♡ A Little Birthday Surprise</title>
<style>
:root{--deep:#32145f;--purple:#7846c8;--pink:#f4b9e8;--lav:#e9dcff;--cream:#fffaff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:"Trebuchet MS",Arial,sans-serif;color:#43245f;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eadbff 0%,#f9e1f4 48%,#d9d5ff 100%);min-height:100vh}
button,a{font:inherit}
a{color:inherit}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:20px 14px}
nav a,.pill{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 18px;border:1px solid #ffffffb8;border-radius:999px;background:#ffffffa6;box-shadow:0 5px 18px #56308014;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;transition:.2s}
nav a:hover,.pill:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:white}
main{width:min(940px,92%);margin:0 auto}
.hero{position:relative;text-align:center;padding:35px 22px 54px;overflow:hidden}
.eyebrow{letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8758b6;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800}
h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,5rem);line-height:1.03;color:var(--deep);margin:13px 0}
h1 span{color:#b34eaa}
.subtitle{max-width:560px;margin:15px auto 24px;line-height:1.7;color:#6a4c83}
.cta{border:0;cursor:pointer;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 24px;color:white;font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#7440c5,#c15eaf);box-shadow:0 9px 24px #7142a54a;transition:.2s}
.cta:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 13px 28px #7142a566}
.sparkle{position:absolute;color:#fff;font-size:25px;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}
.s1{top:15%;left:9%}.s2{top:35%;right:9%;animation-delay:1s}.s3{bottom:12%;left:18%;animation-delay:1.6s}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-13px) rotate(18deg)}}
.bear-wrap{height:155px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin:5px auto 0}
.bear{position:relative;width:120px;height:108px;background:#bd8a68;border-radius:48% 48% 44% 44%;box-shadow:inset -8px -7px #98694f}
.ear{position:absolute;width:39px;height:39px;background:#bd8a68;border:7px solid #98694f;border-radius:50%;top:-14px;z-index:-1}
.ear.left{left:5px}.ear.right{right:5px}
.face{position:absolute;inset:0}
.eye{position:absolute;width:7px;height:9px;background:#3d2940;border-radius:50%;top:42px}
.eye.left{left:37px}.eye.right{right:37px}
.muzzle{position:absolute;left:43px;top:54px;width:36px;height:27px;border-radius:50%;background:#f7d9c8}
.nose{position:absolute;left:14px;top:5px;width:9px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#493044}
.smile{position:absolute;left:15px;top:10px;width:7px;height:6px;border-bottom:2px solid #493044;border-radius:50%}
.arm{position:absolute;right:-20px;top:32px;width:43px;height:19px;border-radius:20px;background:#bd8a68;transform-origin:8px 10px;transform:rotate(-35deg);animation:wave 1s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.paw{position:absolute;right:-23px;top:20px;width:23px;height:23px;border-radius:50%;background:#bd8a68}
@keyframes wave{from{transform:rotate(-28deg)}to{transform:rotate(32deg)}}
.card{background:#ffffffb8;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:28px;padding:clamp(22px,5vw,40px);margin:25px 0;box-shadow:0 18px 50px #59358a18;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.hidden-surprise{display:none}
.hidden-surprise.show{display:block;animation:appear .7s ease}
@keyframes appear{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--deep);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.6rem);margin:0 0 14px}
p{line-height:1.8}
.center{text-align:center}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px;margin-top:22px}
.photo{margin:0;background:#fff;padding:9px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px #3e1e5b18;overflow:hidden}
.photo img{width:100%;height:310px;display:block;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}
.photo figcaption{text-align:center;padding:10px 5px 3px;color:#8a5ba8;font-size:.85rem}
.photo.wide{grid-column:1/-1}
.photo.wide img{height:360px;object-fit:contain;background:#f2e9ff}
.letter{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fffaff,#f0e4ff)}
.letter p{font-size:1.02rem}
.signature{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:#9b4b9f;font-size:1.35rem}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px 10px 45px;color:#795d91;font-size:.85rem}
.hearts{letter-spacing:8px;color:#b65ab0}
@media(max-width:560px){.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}.photo img{height:340px}.photo.wide img{height:300px}.hero{padding-top:25px}.card{border-radius:22px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home ♡</a>
  <a href="#surprise">Open your surprise</a>
  <a href="#birthday-letter">A message for 20</a>
</nav>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <span class="sparkle s1">✦</span><span class="sparkle s2">♡</span><span class="sparkle s3">✧</span>
  <div class="eyebrow">A tiny website made with lots of love</div>
  <div class="bear-wrap" aria-label="A cute bear waving hello">
    <div class="bear"><div class="ear left"></div><div class="ear right"></div><div class="face">
      <i class="eye left"></i><i class="eye right"></i><div class="muzzle"><i class="nose"></i><i class="smile"></i></div>
    </div><div class="arm"></div><div class="paw"></div></div>
  </div>
  <h1>Happy Birthday,<br><span>Minju!</span> ♡</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Someone special deserves a little surprise. So, here's a small purple corner of the internet made just for you.</p>
  <button class="cta" onclick="openSurprise()">Tap to open your surprise ✨</button>
</section>

<section class="card hidden-surprise" id="surprise">
  <div class="center">
    <div class="eyebrow">A little memory collection</div>
    <h2>For my favorite person ♡</h2>
    <p>Every picture holds a little moment worth keeping. I hope these photos remind you how precious you are and how happy I am to have you in my life.</p>
    <div class="hearts">♡ ♡ ♡</div>
  </div>
  <div class="gallery">
    <figure class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Minju smiling in a navy shirt"><figcaption>Your lovely smile ♡</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Minju taking a selfie"><figcaption>A pretty little moment</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Minju smiling for a selfie"><figcaption>Another favorite memory</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Minju sitting in a chair"><figcaption>My birthday girl ✨</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="photo wide"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A video-call screenshot of us together"><figcaption>A little us moment ♡</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <p class="center" style="margin-top:26px">You make ordinary moments feel special. Thank you for being you. 💜</p>
</section>

<section class="card letter" id="birthday-letter">
  <div class="eyebrow">Please read this when you have a moment</div>
  <h2>To my Minju, on your 20th birthday 💌</h2>
  <p>Happy 20th birthday, Minju! Welcome to a new chapter of your life. I hope this year brings you more reasons to smile, more opportunities to grow, and more beautiful memories than you can count.</p>
  <p>I want you to know how thankful I am for you. You are someone I appreciate not only on special days like this, but also in the small, ordinary moments. Your smile, your kindness, your presence, and the little things that make you who you are mean so much to me.</p>
  <p>As you step into your twenties, I hope you never feel pressured to have everything figured out. Take your time, enjoy the journey, celebrate your progress, and be gentle with yourself on difficult days. I will always be cheering for you and wishing the best for every dream you choose to pursue.</p>
  <p>May God guide you, protect you, and bless you with good health, peace, genuine happiness, and people who treat your heart with care. I hope you receive the love and kindness you so freely give.</p>
  <p>Thank you for being part of my story, Minju. No matter how busy life gets, I hope we continue making memories even we are far away, laughing at silly things, supporting each other, and choosing to appreciate every moment we share.</p>
  <p class="center"><strong>Enjoy your day. You deserve to feel celebrated today and every day.</strong></p>
  <p class="signature center">With all my love, always ♡ PAJIEEE♡♡</p>
  <div class="center"><a class="pill" href="#home">Back to the top ↑</a></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer><div class="hearts">♡ ✧ ♡</div>Made especially for Minju · Happy 20th Birthday!</footer>
<script>
function openSurprise(){
  const section=document.getElementById('surprise');
  section.classList.add('show');
  document.querySelector('button.cta').textContent='Your surprise is open! ♡';
  section.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
